# Beast Master — a Strong enemy, the deck as the second expansion (Duels of the Planeswalkers, 1998) replaced it.
# tier: 8/12 Strong enemies — 22 life, bribe 100 gold
# enemy: Beastmaster — the 1997 in-game name (s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES); the deck file, s30 and the wiki call it "Beast Master"
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Duels of the Planeswalkers (second expansion; no colour-keyed sideboard sections)
# source: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Strong) — "Beast Master (Duels of the
#   Planeswalkers)" [Tier-web — no local copy of the Duels enemy files exists in
#   ../shandalar-src, ../s30 or ../mage-go; the wiki lists this variant for 25 of the 55
#   enemies]
# group: Duels of the Planeswalkers
name: Beast Master (Duels of the Planeswalkers)
